sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant H as helm upgrade --install
  participant K as Kubernetes
  participant J as migrate Job
  participant DB as Postgres
  H->>K: hook weight -10: Secret / ExternalSecret
  H->>K: hook weight 0: migrate Job
  K->>J: run ingestion image --spring.profiles.active=migrate
  J->>DB: Flyway as admin role (the only admin credential holder)
  J-->>K: exit 0 (Job deleted on success)
  H->>K: apply ConfigMap, Deployments, Services, HPA, PDB, NetworkPolicies
  K->>K: pods start as sentinel_app, Flyway disabled
  H->>H: --wait for readiness → STATUS deployed
